    "dialogue": [
      {
        "track_type": "对话",
        "start_time": 6.6,
        "duration": 4.44,
        "content": "【您已被公司优化，请到HR办理离职手续】",
        "character": "",
        "voice": "default",
        "volume": 1.0,
        "fade_in": 0.0,
        "fade_out": 0.0,
        "emotion": "平静"
      },
      {
        "track_type": "对话",
        "start_time": 17.7,
        "duration": 6.0,
        "content": "又失业了...第三次了...这日子什么时候是个头...",
        "character": "",
        "voice": "default",
        "volume": 1.0,
        "fade_in": 0.0,
        "fade_out": 0.0,
        "emotion": "平静"
      },
      {
        "track_type": "对话",
        "start_time": 32.9,
        "duration": 8.22,
        "content": "还在为视频剪辑烦恼？AI视频编辑器，一句话生成专业视频！零基础也能做大片！",
        "character": "",
        "voice": "default",
        "volume": 1.0,
        "fade_in": 0.0,
        "fade_out": 0.0,
        "emotion": "平静"
      },
      {
        "track_type": "对话",
        "start_time": 59.0,
        "duration": 6.67,
        "content": "这...这就完了？才30秒？这效果比我之前公司外包做的还好！",
        "character": "",
        "voice": "default",
        "volume": 1.0,
        "fade_in": 0.0,
        "fade_out": 0.0,
        "emotion": "平静"
      },
      {
        "track_type": "对话",
        "start_time": 75.7,
        "duration": 4.67,
        "content": "我...我也能做视频了！我也能靠这个吃饭！",
        "character": "",
        "voice": "default",
        "volume": 1.0,
        "fade_in": 0.0,
        "fade_out": 0.0,
        "emotion": "平静"
      },
      {
        "track_type": "对话",
        "start_time": 93.9,
        "duration": 3.56,
        "content": "陈默？你怎么在这？你不是被...",
        "character": "",
        "voice": "default",
        "volume": 1.0,
        "fade_in": 0.0,
        "fade_out": 0.0,
        "emotion": "平静"
      },
      {
        "track_type": "对话",
        "start_time": 102.8,
        "duration": 4.89,
        "content": "王总，好久不见。我现在做视频创作，自由职业。",
        "character": "",
        "voice": "default",
        "volume": 1.0,
        "fade_in": 0.0,
        "fade_out": 0.0,
        "emotion": "平静"
      },
      {
        "track_type": "对话",
        "start_time": 115.0,
        "duration": 5.78,
        "content": "视频？你？别开玩笑了，你连PPT都做不好，还做视频？",
        "character": "",
        "voice": "default",
        "volume": 1.0,
        "fade_in": 0.0,
        "fade_out": 0.0,
        "emotion": "平静"
      },
      {
        "track_type": "对话",
        "start_time": 129.4,
        "duration": 1.5,
        "content": "您看看这个。",
        "character": "",
        "voice": "default",
        "volume": 1.0,
        "fade_in": 0.0,
        "fade_out": 0.0,
        "emotion": "平静"
      },
      {
        "track_type": "对话",
        "start_time": 137.8,
        "duration": 3.78,
        "content": "这...这真是你做的？用什么做的？",
        "character": "",
        "voice": "default",
        "volume": 1.0,
        "fade_in": 0.0,
        "fade_out": 0.0,
        "emotion": "平静"
      },
      {
        "track_type": "对话",
        "start_time": 147.2,
        "duration": 5.78,
        "content": "用AI视频编辑器做的，一句话就能生成，然后我再微调。",
        "character": "",
        "voice": "default",
        "volume": 1.0,
        "fade_in": 0.0,
        "fade_out": 0.0,
        "emotion": "平静"
      },
      {
        "track_type": "对话",
        "start_time": 160.1,
        "duration": 5.56,
        "content": "原来，翻身只需要一个对的工具，和一个不放弃的自己。",
        "character": "",
        "voice": "default",
        "volume": 1.0,
        "fade_in": 0.0,
        "fade_out": 0.0,
        "emotion": "平静"
      },
      {
        "track_type": "对话",
        "start_time": 174.0,
        "duration": 4.67,
        "content": "AI视频编辑器 —— 让每个人都能创造精彩",
        "character": "",
        "voice": "default",
        "volume": 1.0,
        "fade_in": 0.0,
        "fade_out": 0.0,
        "emotion": "平静"
      }
    ],
